WEBVTT

00:12:56.897 --> 00:13:02.110
doing philanthropy together fills me
with so much joy and hope for the future.

00:13:03.862 --> 00:13:06.490
Maybe when we started

00:13:06.490 --> 00:13:08.992
you thought you were only
coming for dinner.

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:13.747
But actually, you just got
an invitation to change a world.

00:13:14.998 --> 00:13:17.000
Let's meet at your house next time.

00:13:17.584 --> 00:13:18.752
(Spanish) Gracias.

00:13:18.794 --> 00:13:23.841
(Applause and cheers)